Use alloc, core, io, map.
Let table be IntMap of whole number.
Let k be 0.
While k is less than 364.
Put (k times 3) modulo 3001 into int map address of table for key k.
Add 1 to k.
End the loop.
Let found be look up 351 in int map address of table.
If found.has_value, say found.value, otherwise say -1.
Let size be count of int map address of table.
Say size.
Let removed be intmap_remove(address of table, 21).
Say removed.
Free int map address of table.
Let used be bytes in use.
Say used.
Give back 0.
